 "remarks": "An elegant Regency-style residence with dramatic architectural presence is positioned in a premier location just moments from the village. Inside, ten-foot ceilings and Palladian windows flood the home with natural light.  From the barrel-vaulted living room-a true Grand Salon-to the striking onyx-floored dining room, the interior spaces flow effortlessly to an expansive terrace, creating an unforgettable setting for both grand entertaining and quiet family relaxation.  Offering a rare opportunity for luxurious, SINGLE-LEVEL living, the home seamlessly pairs grand scale with absolute privacy. The thoughtfully designed floor plan features a chef's kitchen, a sun-drenched breakfast room, a recreation/playroom, three en-suite bedrooms, and an elegant powder room. Outside, 1.25 acres of sweeping private lawns surround an impressively sized swimming pool, offering a private oasis.  This exceptional residence is located in New Canaan, widely considered the most beautifully preserved New England town within one hour of New York City. Renowned for its unique design, the town's vibrant boutiques, fine dining, outstanding schools, and services are clustered in one charming, walkable center, with the residential community radiating outward in quiet, leafy tranquility.",
